   "html": "<p>The concept brings together the city’s most iconic nightlife brands and record labels, including <strong>Brownies &amp; Lemonade</strong>, <strong>A Club Called Rhonda</strong>, <strong>Electric Feels</strong>, <strong>Pangea Sound</strong> and more with an accompanied livestream, all under one roof to come together as a community in the wake of the fires.</p>\n<p>This event took place in late January at the <strong>Bellwether</strong> with 100% of all proceeds raised going to <strong>California Fire Foundation, MusiCares, Pasadena Humane</strong>, and others.</p>"
  }
 ],
 "sections": [
  {
   "title": "LiveStream Pre-Show",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>We kicked off the night with a special livestream show featuring amazing performances hosted by <strong>Reggie Watts, Hannah Rad, Jesse Camp, Avital Ash, </strong>and <strong>Samantha Urbani</strong>. Special guests included A<strong>aron Frazer, Sizzy Rocket, The Bob Baker Marionette Theater, Sedona</strong>, and many more.</p>"
