   "title": "DJ talent",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>Our event sported secret guests and big name talent curated by each partner. Highlights include <strong>Emo Nite</strong>, <strong>Madeon</strong>, <strong>NGHTMRE</strong>, <strong>NETSKY</strong>, <strong>AC Slater</strong>, <strong>Chris Lorenzo</strong>, <strong>Kito</strong>, <strong>Sylvanesso</strong>, <strong>Chromesparks,</strong> and many more.</p>"
